# DKR's explicit AICAflow SFX residency map.
#
# The source sound IDs are 1-based ALInstrument sound-list entries in
# asset_audio_2.bin.  `bank` entries stay resident by class; `scene` entries
# are loaded only for their level.  `vehicle-masks` has one bit mask per DKR
# scene (car=1, hovercraft=2, plane=4).  This is source policy, not a runtime
# format: afx_n64 lowers the IDs and afx_bank merges each listed pack.
